      "content": "the school records seem too \"perfect\" though. like, everything is so documented and polished in the registry, which is exactly why it feels fake. it's the shadows that bother me. i found a journal from a friend of mine from that same era, and they mention me being \"away for treatment\" during the exact months the school says I was in the honors dorms. if the school records say I was there, but my friend's memory and my own visceral memory say I was elsewhere, doesn't that suggest the official record was intentionally altered? how would a company like that actually go about masking a period of time in public databases?",
